  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large clay tagine or Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add onion, garlic, and ginger, cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add cumin, coriander, paprika, salt, and pepper. Cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the sea bass fillets, skin side up, and cook for 2-3 minutes.",
    "Add 1 cup of water to the tagine and bring to a simmer.",
    "Cover the tagine and cook for 8-10 minutes, or until the fish is cooked through.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley and serve."
